    <bpmn:process id="W_W1361" name="W1361. Multi-Bank Cash Position Daily Aggregation &amp; Automated Zero-Balance Sweep" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Daily treasury operations cycle (every banking day morning)
Frequency: Daily (260 banking days/year)
Volume: 4 banking relationships (BDO, BPI, Metrobank, Chinabank) × multiple accounts per entity (5 entities) = ~20–30 bank and e-wallet settlement accounts aggregated daily (15–20 entity treasury accounts per W309 plus settlement accounts); total daily cash position ~PHP 1–3B across all accounts
Owner: Treasury Analyst
Participants: Treasury Analyst, Treasury Manager, CFO (approval for sweep configuration changes)
Source: workflow W1361 — Multi-Bank Cash Position Daily Aggregation &amp; Automated Zero-Balance Sweep</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1361_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1361_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1361_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1361_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1361_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1361_Lane2" name="Treasury Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1361_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1361_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1361_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1361_Lane3" name="Bank">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1361_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1361_Lane4" name="Treasury Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1361_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1361_End14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1361_Start6" name="Daily treasury operations cycle (every banking day morning)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1361_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1361_Task7" name="System auto-imports previous-day bank statements from all 4 banks (BDO, BPI…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: System auto-imports previous-day bank statements from all 4 banks (BDO, BPI, Metrobank, Chinabank) via BDL/API connection by 8:00 AM
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1361_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1361_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1361_Task8" name="Treasury Analyst reviews imported balances; reconciles any failed imports or…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Treasury Analyst reviews imported balances; reconciles any failed imports or connection errors with respective bank IT support
Responsible (R): Treasury Analyst
Accountable (A): Treasury Manager
Duration: 15–30 min/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1361_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1361_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1361_Task9" name="System generates consolidated cash position report: balances by entity, by…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: System generates consolidated cash position report: balances by entity, by bank, by account type (operating, payroll, LC, petty cash, USD); net available position highlighted
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1361_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1361_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1361_Task10" name="For accounts with ZBS arrangement: bank automatically sweeps positive balances…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: For accounts with ZBS arrangement: bank automatically sweeps positive balances from subsidiary accounts to master concentration account at end of banking day; system records sweep transactions
Responsible (R): Bank / System
Accountable (A): Treasury Manager
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1361_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1361_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1361_Task11" name="Treasury Analyst reviews daily sweep confirmation: verifies sweep amounts match…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Treasury Analyst reviews daily sweep confirmation: verifies sweep amounts match expected balances; investigates any partial or failed sweeps
Responsible (R): Treasury Analyst
Accountable (A): Treasury Manager
Duration: 15 min/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1361_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1361_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1361_Task12" name="Treasury Manager reviews consolidated cash position dashboard by 10:00 AM…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Treasury Manager reviews consolidated cash position dashboard by 10:00 AM; approves any manual fund transfers needed for entities without ZBS (e.g., new accounts not yet in sweep arrangement)
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 15 min/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1361_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1361_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1361_Task13" name="Monthly: Treasury Analyst reconciles sweep transactions across all accounts…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Monthly: Treasury Analyst reconciles sweep transactions across all accounts; confirms ZBS configuration is correct; recommends configuration changes (add/remove accounts, change sweep timing) to Treasury Manager
Responsible (R): Treasury Analyst
Accountable (A): Treasury Manager
Duration: 2–3 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1361_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1361_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1361_End14" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1361_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1361_Annotation15">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-294 (ensure controlled execution — Banking &amp; Payments (PA-18.2).) | - operational: Treasury Analyst review and approval gate; operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: Treasury Analyst</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
