    <bpmn:process id="W_W1362" name="W1362. Vendor Payment Run Execution, File Generation &amp; Multi-Bank Disbursement Processing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Approved vendor payment batch in AP module; or scheduled payment run date (typically twice weekly: Tuesday and Thursday)
Frequency: 2 payment runs/week; ~8–9 runs/month
Volume: ~6,715 merchandise vendor invoices + ~2,000–3,000 non-PO invoices = ~8,500–9,500 AP invoices/month; ~1,000–1,500 invoices paid per run
Owner: Treasury Analyst
Participants: Treasury Analyst, AP Manager (approval), Treasury Manager (final authorization), Bank (processing), CFO (large-value authorization)
Source: workflow W1362 — Vendor Payment Run Execution, File Generation &amp; Multi-Bank Disbursement Processing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1362_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1362_Lane1" name="AP Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1362_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1362_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1362_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1362_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1362_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1362_Lane3" name="Treasury Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1362_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1362_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1362_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1362_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1362_Lane4" name="Treasury Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1362_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1362_End15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1362_Start6" name="Approved vendor payment batch in AP module; or scheduled payment run date (typically…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1362_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1362_Task7" name="AP Manager reviews aged payables; selects invoices for payment in current run…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: AP Manager reviews aged payables; selects invoices for payment in current run based on due date, discount eligibility, and cash availability (W88); proposes payment batch
Responsible (R): AP Manager
Accountable (A): Treasury Manager
Duration: 1–2 hours/run</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1362_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1362_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1362_Task8" name="System applies automatic netting: deducts withholding tax (EWT per BIR rates)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: System applies automatic netting: deducts withholding tax (EWT per BIR rates), offsets vendor debit memos, applies early payment discounts where eligible
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1362_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1362_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1362_Task9" name="Treasury Analyst reviews proposed payment batch: verifies total amount against…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Treasury Analyst reviews proposed payment batch: verifies total amount against cash position forecast, confirms bank account funding sufficiency, checks for duplicate invoices or unusual amounts
Responsible (R): Treasury Analyst
Accountable (A): Treasury Manager
Duration: 30–45 min/run</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1362_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1362_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1362_Task10" name="Treasury Analyst generates payment files per bank: PESONet batch file for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Treasury Analyst generates payment files per bank: PESONet batch file for BDO/BPI/Metrobank domestic transfers; check printing file for check payments; SWIFT MT103 for USD wire transfers; LC settlement instructions for import payments
Responsible (R): Treasury Analyst
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15–30 min/run</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1362_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1362_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1362_Task11" name="Treasury Manager reviews and authorizes payment batch: dual-control sign-off…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Treasury Manager reviews and authorizes payment batch: dual-control sign-off required (Treasury Analyst prepares, Treasury Manager authorizes); for payments &gt; PHP 5M per vendor, CFO authorization also required
Responsible (R): Treasury Manager / CFO
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 15–30 min/run</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1362_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1362_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1362_Task12" name="Treasury Analyst uploads payment files to respective bank portals (BDO, BPI…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Treasury Analyst uploads payment files to respective bank portals (BDO, BPI, Metrobank, Chinabank); confirms file acceptance and processing status
Responsible (R): Treasury Analyst
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15–20 min/run</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1362_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1362_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1362_Task13" name="System updates AP invoices to &quot;Paid&quot; status; generates payment confirmation…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: System updates AP invoices to &quot;Paid&quot; status; generates payment confirmation; transmits remittance advice to vendors via email/vendor portal
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1362_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1362_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1362_Task14" name="Next day: Treasury Analyst reconciles bank debit confirmations against payment…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Next day: Treasury Analyst reconciles bank debit confirmations against payment batch; investigates any rejected or returned payments
Responsible (R): Treasury Analyst
Accountable (A): Treasury Manager
Duration: 15–30 min/run</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1362_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1362_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1362_End15" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1362_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
